<title>USA: Kodak says it is improving its cost structure.</title>
<headline>Kodak says it is improving its cost structure.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co Chairman George Fisher said the company continues to improve its cost structure.</p>
<p>Fisher made his comments in a released statement that accompanied Kodak's fourth-quarter earnings results on Thursday. The company reported earnings of $0.49 per share, including charges, compared with $0.80 per share in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Fisher pointed to the company's accomplishments in 1996 to illustrate ways in which the company has better positioned itself for growth.</p>
</text>
